  "title": "Sausage Stuffed Mushrooms",
  "description": "This recipe for sausage stuffed mushrooms include Johnsonville Italian sausage, cream cheese, Parmesan cheese, lemon, and garlic — a perfect appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "From the Kitchen at Johnsonville Sausage"
